5. Strategy Pattern 
One of the most important.

Problem:
Multiple algorithms.

Example:

Payment:

Payment
 |
 ----------------
 |       |       |
Card   UPI    Paypal


Bad:

if(type=="CARD")
   payCard();

else if(type=="UPI")
   payUPI();



Strategy:

Create interface:

interface PaymentStrategy{
void pay();
}



Implementations:

class CardPayment implements PaymentStrategy{
public void pay(){}
}


class UPIPayment implements PaymentStrategy{
public void pay(){}
}



Runtime selection:

payment.setStrategy(new UPIPayment());
payment.pay();



Used in:

Payment system
Sorting algorithms
Compression algorithms










